1. GRANT OF LICENSE
Ergctl is distributed in two tiers within the commercial binary build:

(a) Free Core Tier (No License Key Required):
You are granted a non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to install
and execute the Free Core features (`probe`, `workout validate`, `export` to
JSON/CSV/TCX/binary FIT, `--dry-run` previews, `restore`, `license status`,
unidirectional `--json` telemetry stream monitoring, and read-only / dry-run
MCP tools) for personal, evaluation, or commercial use.

(b) Pro Perpetual Tier (Valid Polar.sh License Key Required):
Upon purchase of a valid Ergctl Pro license key, Raymond de Oliveira grants
you a perpetual, non-exclusive, non-transferable license for one (1) named
individual to activate and use all Pro features (live `control`, live
`workout run` execution, bidirectional AI-coaching `stream` commands/cues,
interactive raw-mode `tui`, and live mutating MCP tools) on up to three (3)
personal macOS machines. Pro licenses operate offline after activation with
local `0600` key caching (14-day offline grace) and zero usage telemetry.

